    explanation: "AUTHOR LEVEL 6 DESIGN: circuit illustrates initial faults, not
      live wiring. To pass: both LEDs on, branch currents 6-15 mA, source current
      12-30 mA, installed resistors healthy. 470 Ohm can also meet branch target.
      Author drawing only \u2014 NOT verified live circuit topology or measured results."
